<i>♪ You can blame me</i>

01:00:35.271 --> 01:00:37.807
<i>♪ Try to shame me</i>

01:00:37.932 --> 01:00:42.439
<i>♪ And still I'll care for you</i>

01:00:46.920 --> 01:00:49.222
<i>♪ You can run around</i>

01:00:50.926 --> 01:00:53.413
<i>♪ Even put me down</i>

01:00:53.762 --> 01:00:57.879
<i>♪ Still I'll be there for you</i>

